## path-mention VS Code extension

- Verify `task vscode-ext-install` replaces the old junction at `~/.vscode/extensions/local.path-mention-0.1.0` with a real folder and the extension still works after `Developer: Reload Window`.
- Before first `vsce package`: add a `LICENSE` file to `.vscode/extensions/path-mention` (vsce looks only in the extension folder, root `LICENSE` is not found) and set a real marketplace `publisher` if publishing.
